# Scratch / one-off artifacts — never commit these. Editors and ad-hoc scripts
# tend to drop them next to the source they were working on.
*.bak
*.backup
*.orig
*_output.txt
*_results.txt
*lint_output.txt
*_debug.txt
pyrefly_errors*.txt

